s workforce management services in Malaysia. It operates through Foreign Worker Management Services, Manual Labour Services, Hostel Management Services, and Other Ancillary Services segments. The company offers human resources management services comprising arrangement of foreign workers, recruitment and selection, and performance management; accommodation and transportation services consisting of flight coordination, transportation arrangements, and accommodation placement; administration services, such as work permit applications with yearly renewal, FOMEMA and insurance coverage, documentation management, and passport renewal; and hostel management services, including hostel arrangement and utilities management, as well as hostel repair, security, and maintenance services. It also provides consultation and advisory services, such as professional consultation, ongoing regulatory updates, and compliance guidance; welfare solutions, including medical benefits, counseling, healthcare needs, and training; and payroll management services, which include payroll administration, on-time salary payment, and overtime calculations and deductions. In addition, the company offers remittance, manual labor, and sanitizing services; insurance products and services, human resource consultancy, and personnel services; and general services. Further, it provides commercial cleaning services comprising exterior and interior commercial cleaning, commercial carpet maintenance, commercial floor restoration and maintenance, and commercial facility maintenance services; and high-rise cleaning services consisting of high-rise facade cleaning, internal and external glass cleaning, building maintenance, and air well cleaning services. The company serves the food and beverage, retail, consumer goods, healthcare, property, and construction sectors. Manforce Group Berhad was founded in 2004 and is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia."}}